IP-CIDR, 120.241.143.11/32, REJECT, no-resolve
IP-CIDR, 120.241.143.12/32, REJECT, no-resolve
IP-CIDR, 120.241.143.18/32, REJECT, no-resolve
IP-CIDR, 120.241.143.19/32, REJECT, no-resolve
IP-CIDR, 120.241.143.129/32, REJECT, no-resolve
